{"2695500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rushcremental", "steam_appid": 2695500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5149990], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rushcremental is an active incremental game about searching for scrap resources and building a racecar to rule over the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Collect Resources in the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/a30420011d50b0bf3627bf97553d11ad.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/a30420011d50b0bf3627bf97553d11ad.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/a30420011d50b0bf3627bf97553d11ad.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rushcremental is a simple incremental game. Use the cursor to search through the wasteland and discover scrap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/634e4bc2db3cff68190db3fa617d65e8.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/634e4bc2db3cff68190db3fa617d65e8.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/634e4bc2db3cff68190db3fa617d65e8.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend scrap resources to unlock upgrades on a huge skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you search with more power and become ruler of the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Challengers for New Territories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/2c1092a64cab6864ceece9f77b7d1c5f.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/2c1092a64cab6864ceece9f77b7d1c5f.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/2c1092a64cab6864ceece9f77b7d1c5f.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level you, you gain points. Spend these points to challenge racers in Rush Wars. Each race brings you closer to total domination of the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Community Camp for Idle Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/5ccf8a035b22966f78111eca0575f0f7.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/5ccf8a035b22966f78111eca0575f0f7.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/5ccf8a035b22966f78111eca0575f0f7.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain enough fame to build a community camp where scrap is instantly delivered for you. The camp is the idle mechanic of Rushcremental.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing active incremental game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for faster resource collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing in a post-apocalyptic wasteland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Definitive ending <i>(not infinite!)</i></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rushcremental is an active incremental game about searching for scrap resources and building a racecar to rule over the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Collect Resources in the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/a30420011d50b0bf3627bf97553d11ad.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/a30420011d50b0bf3627bf97553d11ad.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/a30420011d50b0bf3627bf97553d11ad.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rushcremental is a simple incremental game. Use the cursor to search through the wasteland and discover scrap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/634e4bc2db3cff68190db3fa617d65e8.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/634e4bc2db3cff68190db3fa617d65e8.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/634e4bc2db3cff68190db3fa617d65e8.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend scrap resources to unlock upgrades on a huge skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you search with more power and become ruler of the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Challengers for New Territories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/2c1092a64cab6864ceece9f77b7d1c5f.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/2c1092a64cab6864ceece9f77b7d1c5f.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/2c1092a64cab6864ceece9f77b7d1c5f.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level you, you gain points. Spend these points to challenge racers in Rush Wars. Each race brings you closer to total domination of the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Community Camp for Idle Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/5ccf8a035b22966f78111eca0575f0f7.poster.avif?t=1787744691\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/5ccf8a035b22966f78111eca0575f0f7.webm?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/extras/5ccf8a035b22966f78111eca0575f0f7.mp4?t=1787744691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain enough fame to build a community camp where scrap is instantly delivered for you. The camp is the idle mechanic of Rushcremental.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing active incremental game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for faster resource collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing in a post-apocalyptic wasteland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Definitive ending <i>(not infinite!)</i></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An active incremental game about searching for scraps and drag racing to rule over all the territories in the wasteland.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/f0361e3a7852b2cdf9fb604fa0b70efc16507907/header.jpg?t=1787744691", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/84d4c751f212676d5c503acc033e1e602cf5ee85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787744691", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695500/84d4c751f212676d5c503acc033e1e602cf5ee85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787744691", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64bits<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13.7.8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel (Silicon Untested)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2 Core<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"mini